(7750287, 1279908, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like I gave this a 7. Putting my critical thinking cap on:<br/>-I like the leading lines of the dock. I might have cropped it a little tighter on the left to put the near end in the rule of third zone.<br/>-The highlight details on the water are blown out. It''s a hard thing to expose for at sunset.<br/>-Maybe a little to orangey for me. I kind of like balancing my sunsets with a little more blue in the sky. But that is a personal preference and a nitpick.</td>', 'Looks like I gave this a 7. Putting my critical thinking cap on:-I like the leading lines of the dock. I might have cropped it a little tighter on the left to put the near end in the rule of third zone.-The highlight details on the water are blown out. It''s a hard thing to expose for at sunset.-Maybe a little to orangey for me. I kind of like balancing my sunsets with a little more blue in the sky. But that is a personal preference and a nitpick.', '2023-06-16 16:27:07.000000', NULL, 0);
